    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "peace in the quiet... what does that even mean? it just feels like no matter how much i rest, the morning always comes back and i have to do it all over again. i'm just so done with the cycle. it feels like there's no real way to actually find that peace, you know? it's all just temporary.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
